ocus Research Grants: If your research focuses on hemoglobinopathies, you will have a competitive advantage in the sele\"}], \"local_exploration\": {\"visited_doc_ids\": [\"web-307533c1a4508473094316ab\", \"web-f3aba4b966c28f155f997043\", \"web-e00b0a496819dad9ea1b68ec\", \"web-81c57feef95692fb83b63747\", \"web-fa499d75bb6176a42b1557b3\"], \"visited_pages\": [{\"doc_id\": \"web-307533c1a4508473094316ab\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/\", \"title\": \"Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-f3aba4b966c28f155f997043\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants\", \"title\": \"Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-e00b0a496819dad9ea1b68ec\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants/about-our-eha-research-grants\", \"title\": \"EHA Research Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)EHA Research Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-81c57feef95692fb83b63747\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants/eha-bilateral-collaborative-grant\", \"title\": \"EHA Bilateral Collaborative Grant - The European Hematology Association (EHA)EHA Bilateral Collaborative Grant - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-fa499d75bb6176a42b1557b3\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation\", \"title\": \"Research & Innovation - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Research & Innovation - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}], \"visited_doc_count\": 5, \"omitted_visited_doc_id_count\": 0, \"failed_urls\": [], \"failed_url_count\": 0, \"omitted_failed_url_count\": 0, \"presentation\": \"bounded_recent_preview_full_session_retained\", \"frontier_links\": 127}, \"navigation_decision\": {\"protocol\": \"next_hop_